    "title": "Gales of November - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joan Farnam ,\n2 hours ago Greetings from the North Shore, where the weather doesn’t disappoint. Warm fall days have been a boon this year, yes, but we did get our first November Gale over the weekend. It reminded us of the truth about Lake Superior — she can be dangerous and should never be underestimated. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
